{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-rom-7-1","title":"Romans 7:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 No law hath power over a man longer than he lives. 4 But we are dead to the law. 7 Yet is not the law sin; 12 but holy, just and good; 16 as I acknowledge, who am grieved because I cannot keep it.</p>\n<p>Know. 6:3 brethren. 9:3; 10:1 them that. 2:17,18; Ezr 7:25; Pr 6:23; 1Co 9:8; Ga 4:21 the law. 6; 6:14 a man.Or, person, either man or woman; [anthropos ] and {homo} having this extent of signification.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-7-2","title":"Romans 7:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>the woman.Rather, a woman. The apostle here illustrates the position laid down in the preceding verse by a familiar instance.</p>\n<p>Ge 2:23,24; Nu 30:7,8; 1Co 7:4,39</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-7-3","title":"Romans 7:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>So then. Ex 20:14; Le 20:10; Nu 5:13-31; De 22:22-24; Mt 5:32; Mr 10:6-12 Joh 8:3-5 through. Ru 2:13; 1Sa 25:39-42; 1Ti 5:11-14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-7-4","title":"Romans 7:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>ye also. 6; 6:14; 8:2; Ga 2:19,20; 3:13; 5:18; Eph 2:15; Col 2:14,20 the body. Mt 26:26; Joh 6:51; 1Co 10:16; Heb 10:10; 1Pe 2:24 that ye. Ps 45:10-15; Isa 54:5; 62:5; Ho 2:19,20; Joh 3:29; 2Co 11:2 Eph 5:23-27; Re 19:7; 21:9 that we. 6:22; Ps 45:16; Joh 15:8; Ga 5:22,23; Php 1:11; 4:17; Col 1:6,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-7-5","title":"Romans 7:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>in the flesh. 8:8,9; Joh 3:6; Ga 5:16,17,24; Eph 2:3,11; Tit 3:3 motions. Gr. passions. 1:26; *Gr: which. 3:20; 4:15; 5:20; 1Co 15:56; 2Co 3:6-9; Ga 3:10; Jas 2:9,10; 1Jo 3:4 did work. 8-13; Mt 15:19; Ga 5:19-21; Jas 1:15 members. 23; 6:13,19; Col 3:5; Jas 4:1 bring. 6:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-7-6","title":"Romans 7:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>But. 4; 6:14,15; Ga 3:13,23-25; 4:4,5 that being dead. or, being dead to that. 1,4; 6:2 serve. 1:9; 2:27-29; 6:4,11,19,22; 12:2; Eze 11:19; 36:26; 2Co 3:6; 5:17 Ga 2:19,20; 6:15; Php 3:3; Col 3:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-7-7","title":"Romans 7:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>What. 3:5; 4:1; 6:15 is the law. 8,11,13; 1Co 15:56 I had. 5; 3:20; Ps 19:7-12; 119:96 lust. or, concupiscence. 8; 1Th 4:5 Thou shalt. 13:9; Ge 3:6; Ex 20:17; De 5:21; Jos 7:21; 2Sa 11:2; 1Ki 21:1-4 Mic 2:2; Mt 5:28; Lu 12:15; Ac 20:33; Eph 5:3; Col 3:5; 1Jo 2:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-7-8","title":"Romans 7:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>sin. 11,13,17; 4:15; 5:20 wrought. Jas 1:14,15 For without, etc.Rather, \"For without a law sin is dead.\" Where there is no law, there is no transgression; for sin is the transgression of the law: the very essence of sin consists in the violation of some positive law.</p>\n<p>4:15; Joh 15:22,24; 1Co 15:56</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-7-9","title":"Romans 7:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>For I. Mt 19:20; Lu 10:25-29; 15:29; 18:9-12,21; Php 3:5,6 without. Mt 5:21-26; 15:4-6; Mr 7:8-13 but. 3:19,20; 10:5; Ps 40:12; Ga 3:10; Jas 2:10,11 sin. 21-23; 8:7 and I died. 4,6; *marg: 11; 3:20; Ga 2:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-7-10","title":"Romans 7:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>10:5; Le 18:5; Eze 20:11,13,21; Lu 10:27-29; 2Co 3:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-7-11","title":"Romans 7:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>sin. 8,13 deceived. Isa 44:20; Jer 17:9; 49:16; Ob 1:3; Eph 4:22; Heb 3:13; Jas 1:22,26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-7-12","title":"Romans 7:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>the law. 14; 3:31; 12:2; De 4:8; 10:12; Ne 9:13; Ps 19:7-12; 119:38,86,127,137 Ps 119:140,172; 1Ti 1:8 the commandment. 7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-7-13","title":"Romans 7:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>then. 8:3; Ga 3:21 But sin. 8-11; 5:20; Jas 1:13-15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-7-14","title":"Romans 7:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>the law. Le 19:18; De 6:5; Ps 51:6; Mt 5:22,28; 22:37-40; Heb 4:12 but. 18,22,23; Job 42:6; Ps 119:25; Pr 30:2,5; Isa 6:5; 64:5,6; Lu 5:8 Lu 7:6; 18:11-14; Eph 3:8 carnal. Mt 16:23; 1Co 3:1-3 sold. 24; Ge 37:27,36; 40:15; Ex 21:2-6; 22:3; 1Ki 21:20,25; 2Ki 17:17 Isa 50:1; 52:3; Am 2:6; Mt 18:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-7-15","title":"Romans 7:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>For that. 14:22; Lu 11:48 allow. or, know. Ps 1:6; Na 1:7; 2Ti 2:19 what. 16,19,20; 1Ki 8:46; Ps 19:12; 65:3; 119:1-6,32,40; Ec 7:20; Ga 5:17 Php 3:12-14; Jas 3:2; 1Jo 1:7,8 what I hate. 12:9; Ps 36:4; 97:10; 101:3; 119:104,113,128,163; Pr 8:13; 13:5 Am 5:15; Heb 1:9; Jude 1:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-7-16","title":"Romans 7:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>I consent. 12,14,22; Ps 119:127,128</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-7-17","title":"Romans 7:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>it is no more. 20; 4:7,8; 2Co 8:12; Php 3:8,9 sin. 18,20,23; Jas 4:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-7-18","title":"Romans 7:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>that in me. Ge 6:5; 8:21; Job 14:4; 15:14-16; 25:4; Ps 51:5; Isa 64:6; Mt 15:19 Mr 7:21-23; Lu 11:13; Eph 2:1-5; Tit 3:3; 1Pe 4:2 in my. 5,25; 8:3-13; 13:14; Joh 3:6; Ga 5:19-21,24 for to will. 15,19,25; Ps 119:5,32,40,115-117,173,176; Ga 5:17; Php 2:13; 3:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-7-20","title":"Romans 7:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>it is no. 17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-7-21","title":"Romans 7:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>a law. 23; 6:12,14; 8:2; Ps 19:13; 119:133; Joh 8:34; Eph 6:11-13; 2Pe 2:19 evil. 2Ch 30:18,19; Ps 19:12; 40:12; 65:3; 119:37; Isa 6:5-7; Zec 3:1-4 Lu 4:1; Heb 2:17; 4:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-7-22","title":"Romans 7:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>I delight. 8:7; Job 23:12; Ps 1:2; 19:8-10; 40:8; 119:16,24,35,47,48,72,92 Ps 119:97-104,111,113,127,167,174; Isa 51:7; Joh 4:34; Heb 8:10 inward. 2:29; 2Co 4:16; Eph 3:16; Col 3:9; 1Pe 3:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-7-23","title":"Romans 7:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>another. 5,21,25; 8:2; Ec 7:20; Ga 5:17; 1Ti 6:11,12; Heb 12:4; Jas 3:2; 4:1 1Pe 2:11 member. 6:13,19 and. 14; Ps 142:7; 2Ti 2:25,26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-7-24","title":"Romans 7:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>wretched. 8:26; 1Ki 8:38; Ps 6:6; 32:3,4; 38:2,8-10; 77:3-9; 119:20,81-83,131 Ps 119:143,176; 130:1-3; Eze 9:4; Mt 5:4,6; 2Co 12:7-9; Re 21:4 who. De 22:26,27; Ps 71:11; 72:12; 91:14,15; 102:20; Mic 7:19 Zec 9:11,12; Lu 4:18; 2Co 1:8-10; 2Ti 4:18; Tit 2:14; Heb 2:15 the body of this. or, this body of. 6:6; 8:13; Ps 88:5; Col 2:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-7-25","title":"Romans 7:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":7,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":7,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>thank God. 6:14,17; Ps 107:15,16; 116:16,17; Isa 12:1; 49:9,13; Mt 1:21 1Co 15:57; 2Co 9:15; 12:9,10; Eph 5:20; Php 3:3; 4:6; Col 3:17 1Pe 2:5,9 So then. 15-24; Ga 5:17-24</p>"}]}